# EmailJS — contact forms send from the browser (works with static Cloudflare Pages export).
# Copy to .env.local and fill from https://dashboard.emailjs.com/admin
#
# 1. Create a Service (e.g. Gmail) and connect your inbox.
# 2. Create an Email Template linked to that service.
#    Subject: GEN website — {{form_type}} — {{name}}
#    Body: paste HTML from emailjs-contact-template-body.html in this repo.
#    Reply-To: {{reply_to}} (in template settings, if supported).
# 3. Account → API Keys → copy Public Key.
# 4. Restrict the public key to your domain in EmailJS (recommended).
#
# Template placeholders:
# {{form_type}} {{name}} {{from_name}} {{email}} {{reply_to}} {{organization}}
# {{job_title}} {{country}} {{program_interest}} {{cohort_size}}
# {{training_objectives}} {{subject}} {{message}}
#
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
